sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Frontend)
    participant A as API Server
    participant DB as SQLite (Drizzle)
    participant S as Socket.io

    U->>A: POST /api/posts (JWT Token + Content)
    activate A
    A->>A: Validate JWT & Payload (Zod)
    A->>DB: INSERT INTO posts
    activate DB
    DB-->>A: Post Created
    deactivate DB
    A->>S: emit('newPost', postData)
    activate S
    S-->>U: Broadcast to Followers
    deactivate S
    A-->>U: 201 Created Response
    deactivate A
    U->>U: Update UI & Cache (React Query)
